cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ORBIT, please cite the paper and this software."
title: "ORBIT: Function-Space Optimization for Rotary Query-Key Interactions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pop
    given-names: Alexandru
repository-code: "https://github.com/pop123-ux/ORBIT"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  ORBIT is a research optimizer for RoPE-based Transformer language models that
  preconditions Muon query/key updates with local function-space metrics derived
  from rotary attention geometry while preserving the combined Q/K update norm.
keywords:
  - optimization
  - transformers
  - RoPE
  - Muon
  - attention
license: MIT
